    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You brandish the weapon used to cast the spell and conjure spectral copies of it (or of ammunition suited to it) that fly forward and then vanish. Each creature of your choice that you can see in a 60-foot Cone makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 5d8 Force damage on a failure or half as much on a success.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 3.</p>",
